#. committee.body
#: src/js/academic-model.js:366
msgctxt "text:committee.body"
msgid ""
"The committee ruled “{value0}” at {value1}/100. Question slips remain; "
"Marisa wants material provenance attached before the celebratory drink."
msgstr "委員會以 {value0}/100 裁定「{value1}」。逐問回條仍保留；魔理沙要求把材料來源附在慶祝酒之前。"

#. corridor/author
#: src/js/academic-model.js:367
