msgid "Anonymous Listener Outside the Defence Room"
msgstr "答辯會場門外的匿名旁聽生"

#. corridor/title
#: src/js/academic-model.js:367
msgctxt "tree:corridor#/title"
msgid "Question: does a claim grow after it passes?"
msgstr "問：通過後，主張會不會自己變大？"

#. corridor/body
#: src/js/academic-model.js:367
msgctxt "tree:corridor#/body"
msgid ""
"The project passed only within its declared place, moon phase, and version. "
"Yukari left with the word “within”; the committee is requesting its return."
msgstr "剛才的題目只在申報場地、月相與版本內通過。八雲紫離場時把「內」字帶走了，委員會正在要求歸還。"
